"Each new SMS is tried in this order:" = "每条新短信按以下顺序处理：";
"1. Rules in the Rules tab, including defaults like GİB e-Arşiv" = "1. “规则”标签页中的规则，包括 GİB e-Arşiv 等默认规则";
